    "created_at": "2016-08-10T13:20:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-10T13:20:03Z",
    "body": "Getting this right seems non-trivial and the benefit of checking this at all also seems marginal. I suggest we drop this from the spec at this time. Conformance checkers can still experiment with checking this and we can re-add something to the spec later if there is interest.\n",
