    "body": "I think the switch to using isolation for HTML `dir` mappings makes the use case for this section a lot less compelling, fwiw. If you make sure any potentially-screwed-up strings are encased in an isolating element, then you shouldn't have any problems since the PDI will terminate any open embeddings/overrides within its scope.",
